= Pharmaceutical preparation
{parent=Pharmacy}

A compounded medicinal form defined by its ingredients, process and specified strength. Historical names require an edition-specific formula.

= Rose water
{parent=Pharmaceutical preparation}

= Cinnamon water
{parent=Pharmaceutical preparation}

= Ammonium acetate solution
{parent=Pharmaceutical preparation}

