= Infusum Digitalis
{parent=Digitalis preparation}
{c}

Historical formulation name; composition is identified by pharmacopoeial edition.

= Digitalin
{parent=Digitalis preparation}

Historical pharmaceutical term covering preparations with different solubilities and compositions. It must not automatically be identified with one pure modern <cardiac glycoside>.

