= Tincture
{parent=Pharmacognosy}

A liquid medicinal preparation obtained with a specified solvent and formulation. Different editions and pharmacopoeias may assign different concentrations to a similar name.

= Percolator
{parent=Pharmacognosy}

An extraction vessel through which a solvent passes through a packed powdered material. The dissolved extract leaves through the lower outlet.

