= Elaterium
{parent=Plant medicinal material}

Historical drastic <purgative> obtained as the dried deposit from the expressed juice of the squirting cucumber fruit. Its variable potency and severe fluid loss make period use in <oedema> unsuitable as a modern treatment recommendation.

